  <ReadMe/>
  <Overview>mdf-server Syd (like-for-like replacement of old mdf-server on unraid-syd, native Tailscale-in-container, failover secondary).&#13;
Tailscale hostname mdf-server-syd, joined to pygmy-bramble.&#13;
Auth key is placeholder - Gary will set real key via Unraid UI.&#13;
Runs as root for the Tailscale hook, drops to bun (uid 1000) via su-exec for the app.&#13;
Carried forward existing appdata (feed-events.ndjson history) from the old container.&#13;
ACL: needs tag:misc-services-equivalent grant for port 3000 when failover work is ready (Gary to apply).&#13;
</Overview>
